course: dictionary
lesson: 11430
title: Activated: switched on and ready
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: «Activated» is the past form of the verb «activate», so it tells you that something has been started or switched on. Look at the word's root to find the action: activate means to make something start working.
explain: «The smoke alarm was activated by the smoke from the toast.» The smoke set the alarm off, so the alarm started working. Ask yourself what switched it on. The words after «by» give you the clue. Try your meaning in the sentence: "The smoke alarm was started by the smoke" still makes sense.
explain: The word can also describe a thing. «Activated charcoal» is charcoal that has been treated so it soaks up more dirt and gas. «Voice-activated» joins two words, voice and activated, so it means something switches on when it hears your voice.
fact: Activated means switched on, or made to start working.
fact: «Activated» is the past form of the verb «activate»: activate, activates, activating, activated.
fact: «Activated by» tells you what switched something on, as in «The sprinkler was activated by heat.»
fact: In science, «activated» can mean made ready to act or react, as in «activated charcoal», which soaks up more stuff.
fact: A plan, a team or your body's defences can also be activated, which means they have been called into action.
exercise: «The smoke alarm was activated by the smoke from the toast.» What does activated mean here? | Put away in a box | Made very quiet | Covered in smoke | *Switched on and started working
exercise: «My tablet is voice-activated, so it wakes up when I speak.» What does voice-activated suggest? | It is made of wood | *It switches on when it hears your voice | It can be read like a book | It only works in the dark
exercise: «The sprinkler was activated by heat.» Find and copy the word that names what switched the sprinkler on. | activated | was | sprinkler | *heat
test: «The robot activated its lights when it entered the dark room.» What does activated most nearly mean? | *Switched on | Broke | Painted | Forgotten
test: A water filter has activated charcoal inside it. What does activated tell you about the charcoal? | Burnt to ash and thrown away | Frozen solid | Coloured bright blue | *Treated so it soaks up more
exam: «The team was activated to help after the flood.» What does activated mean? | Made smaller | Sent to bed | Sorry for what happened | *Called into action
